Dear community members=2C=0A=

=0A=
Im a graphic designer and for the last couple of months I have been working=
 on a new logo for the Nouveau project. After sending preliminary designs t=
o both Martin Peres and Ilia Mirkin=2C we have decided to share the logo in=
 order to gather your feedback. =0A=

=0A=
I would like to highlight that the logo incorporates a penguin correspondin=
g to the linux kernel components used to create this open source driver. Th=
e 3D cube/shape represents the 2D and 3D acceleration capability. The =93n=
=94 simply stands for the first letter in Nouveau and the green colour was =
chosen because the driver is for NVIDIA video cards.=0A=

=0A=
Please provide Martin and Ilia with your comments and preferences=2C since =
they both have been the ones giving me the design requirements.=20
Valeria Aguilera. 		 	   		  =

